:name: I2C temperature sensor on the BlackPill F411 model
:description: I2C1 + TMP103 model; change the reading with `sysbus.i2c1.tmp103 Temperature 30`.
$elf?=$ex_out/i2c_demo.elf

using sysbus
mach create "i2c"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/blackpill_i2c.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
sysbus LoadELF $elf
sysbus.i2c1.tmp103 Temperature 24
